  "translation": "Ndipo Asa adaitana kwa Yahwe Elohim wake, nadzati: “Yahwe, palibe wina koma iwe wothandiza, pakati pa wamphamvu ndi wopanda mphamvu; tithandizeni, Yahwe Elohim wathu, chifukwa pa iwe tatsimikizira, ndi m'Dzina lako tabwera pa gulu ili lalikulu. Yahwe Elohim wathu, iwe ⟨ndiwe⟩; musalole munthu wamoyo kudzikuza pamaso panu.”",
